From eb76cc567099b780ac02d42d631754e06e030f65 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: minimax-1 <minimax-1@swarmagents.local>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 15:46:03 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(app): public landing page for signed-out visitors

GET / no longer redirects to /login: an unauthenticated visitor gets a
server-rendered landing page explaining the persistent Linux VM, with
Sign in (-> /login) and Create account CTAs plus FAQ/Docs/Privacy links.
Signed-in users still land in the workspace; every other path (including
/providers and all of /api/*) stays behind the auth gate.
